# olo_base_cc_bits, olo_base_cc_simple, olo_base_reset_gen and olo_base_ram_sdp wherever the system uses them, also
# inside the cores. tools/vivado/all_constraints_amd.tcl would also read those of olo_intf_sync, which expect device
# pins at its input and stop the build (ERROR 18-513) where a block synchronises internal signals with it, as ofb_pa_gty
